    "perek_title": "גט פשוט",
    "perek_number": 10
  },
  "english": [
    "<b>It is</b> only <b>a guarantor</b> who undertakes a loan guarantee <b>in</b> the presence of <b>a court who does not require an act of acquisition; this</b> indicates that <b>generally,</b> a guarantor <b>requires an act of acquisition</b> in order to be obligated to pay.",
    "The Gemara concludes: <b>And the <i>halakha</i></b> is that <b>a guarantor</b> who accepts responsibility for the loan <b>at the time of the giving of the money does not require an act of acquisition;</b> but if he accepts responsibility <b>after the giving of the money,</b> he <b>requires an act of acquisition.</b> Moreover, <b>a guarantor</b> who undertakes a loan guarantee <b>in</b> the presence of a <b>court does not require an act of acquisition, as</b> in return <b>for that gratification that</b> he experiences in that the court <b>trusts him, he resolves to obligate himself.</b>"
  ],
  "gemara": [
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"0\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>עָרֵב דְּבֵית דִּין הוּא דְּלָא בָּעֵי קִנְיָן, הָא בְּעָלְמָא בָּעֵי",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "קִנְיָן. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"1\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>וְהִלְכְתָא: עָרֵב <span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"0\" data-marker-letter=\"א\">א</span>בִּשְׁעַת מַתַּן מָעוֹת – לֹא בָּעֵי קִנְיָן,",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "אַחַר <span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"1\" data-marker-letter=\"ב\">ב</span>מַתַּן מָעוֹת – בָּעֵי קִנְיָן. עָרֵב <span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"2\" data-marker-letter=\"ג\">ג</span>דְּבֵית דִּין – לָא בָּעֵי",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "0px",
      "width": "450px",
      "text": "קִנְיָן; דִּבְהָהִיא הֲנָאָה דִּמְהֵימַן לֵיהּ – גָּמַר וּמְשַׁעְבֵּד לֵיהּ<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"585\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"2\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><br><br><big><strong>הֲדַרַן עֲלָךְ גֵּט פָּשׁוּט, וּסְלִיקָא לַהּ מַסֶּכֶת בָּבָא בָּתְרָא</strong></big><br><br>",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    }
  ],
